.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-maintainers-add 1  "swarm 0.2.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-maintainers\-add \- Authorize a key (root key only), optionally limited to ref globs
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm maintainers add\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREPO\fR> <\fIKEY\fR> [\fIGLOBS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Authorize a key (root key only), optionally limited to ref globs
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIREPO\fR>

.TP
<\fIKEY\fR>
The maintainer\*(Aqs key ID, from `swarm key new` or `swarm key id`
.TP
[\fIGLOBS\fR]
Ref globs the key may publish (default refs/heads/*)
